Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:03:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Fail closed on missing downstream reviewer
 provenance

Review classification must not depend on successful implementer evidence lookup. Evicted creator cards otherwise turn title-marked reviews into ordinary pinned tasks. Refuse missing source cards even when another source yields a partial author set.

Proof: real dispatcher tick regression reproduced an implementer-pin spawn on baseline; missing/partial evidence now refuses. Intact mandatory and nonmandatory pins remain covered. All nine direct consumer suites pass. Three predicate-removal mutants fail the new admission suite. Further shipping validation and live replay are tracked by t_0561b861cd9150b4.
